WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.009 --> 00:00:07.736
"My dear," the king said to Fiona.

2
00:00:07.737 --> 00:00:10.769
"This is the Duke of Carabas."

3
00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:16.081
Carabas bowed.

4
00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:19.697
"It is nice to meet you," Fiona said.

5
00:00:19.698 --> 00:00:22.987
"You have a lovely cat."

6
00:00:22.988 --> 00:00:27.387
Carabas grinned. "Thank you."

7
00:00:27.388 --> 00:00:29.213
The king smiled.

8
00:00:29.214 --> 00:00:31.581
"My daughter and I are taking a ride.

9
00:00:31.582 --> 00:00:36.896
Join us."

10
00:00:36.897 --> 00:00:42.754
"Perfect!" Puss thought, sneaking away.

11
00:00:42.755 --> 00:00:46.440
"Puss can come too," the king said.

12
00:00:46.441 --> 00:00:49.001
He looked around.

13
00:00:49.002 --> 00:00:51.855
"Where did he go?"

14
00:00:51.856 --> 00:00:57.925
Carabas scratched his head. "I don't know."

15
00:00:57.926 --> 00:01:05.422
Carabas climbed into the carriage.

16
00:01:05.423 --> 00:01:10.702
"Fiona, your music is beautiful," he said.

17
00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:14.002
"Can you play for me?"

18
00:01:14.003 --> 00:01:17.003
Fiona blushed.

19
00:01:17.004 --> 00:01:23.918
She picked up her guitar and played.

20
00:01:23.919 --> 00:01:34.423
Meanwhile Puss ran far ahead of the carriage.

21
00:01:34.424 --> 00:01:38.008
Puss saw men cutting hay in a meadow.

22
00:01:38.009 --> 00:01:45.362
"Hello!" he called.

23
00:01:45.363 --> 00:01:48.044
"The king will be coming along soon.

24
00:01:48.045 --> 00:01:52.285
Tell him the Duke of Carabas owns this meadow."

25
00:01:52.286 --> 00:01:56.885
"That cat talks!" one man cried.

26
00:01:56.886 --> 00:02:04.233
"We won't lie to the king," another said.

27
00:02:04.234 --> 00:02:10.339
Puss showed his claws. "Yes, you will!"

28
00:02:10.340 --> 00:02:17.304
"Yikes!" the men cried.

29
00:02:17.305 --> 00:02:24.760
The carriage soon passed the meadow.

30
00:02:24.761 --> 00:02:31.123
"Who owns this meadow?" the king asked.

31
00:02:31.124 --> 00:02:37.943
"The Duke of Carabas owns it," one man said.

32
00:02:37.944 --> 00:02:40.672
The king looked at Carabas.

33
00:02:40.673 --> 00:02:43.961
"Very impressive, Duke!"

34
00:02:43.962 --> 00:02:50.851
Carabas was confused, but he stayed quiet.

